---
ext-data-sh
-- simple metadata standard for storing on externally managed files
---- in mostly pure sh!
---
Plan
-- the plan for this project is to eventually read and export the metadata of flac, vogg vorbis, and opus files
---- this will then be supplemented with a standard to document the locations of other copies on third-party platforms
  >>>> both of these are far off, but work will begin with flac
---
Intended offerings
-- this is additionally intended to offer a standardized system for multiple artists and genres
---
Dependencies
-- only something to raw read data from files
---- such as od(1) and a wrapper
---